# The Soulfind build devenv/ uses (ADR-013): upstream's rolling release "latest" at the commit below, pinned by each
# platform's GitHub asset id and SHA-256 (from the release's own digests, checked again after download). Upstream
# replaces the build under the same tag from time to time: the old asset id then stops resolving and
# fetch-soulfind.sh fails loudly, never with a different binary. To move the pin, see README.md ("Updating Soulfind").
